{"type":"TEXT","ticket":57216,"id":"5e742e2676b14151"}||{"x":100,"y":1020,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:电路解析｜GPIO直接发送","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":57217,"id":"db9fc220e92f44f1"}||{"x":100,"y":988,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:GPIO14（DUT_UART_TX）→ R79=100Ω → TOOL_TX → 设备RX。\n取消U16、R76/R77及C26；GPIO38释放为预留，发送线上无工具侧上拉。\n禁发送时，固件须解除TX外设驱动，设为输入并关闭上下拉；启用由AI明确控制。\n上电、复位阶段引脚状态须实测；100Ω只用于边沿调试，不提供掉电隔离。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":57218,"id":"2e205fc222194f2e"}||{"x":100,"y":250,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"电路解析｜持续接收","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":57219,"id":"8acdcb622abb4ac8"}||{"x":100,"y":218,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"TOOL_RX → R80=100Ω → U17 施密特缓冲 → MCU RX。\nR78=470kΩ提供输入下拉，C27提供局部去耦；未连接时接收端为低。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":57220,"id":"b6249966911b41c8"}||{"x":1480,"y":700,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"接线与掉电测试","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":57221,"id":"77edf0ada61d4c7a"}||{"x":1480,"y":668,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:工具TX接设备RX，工具RX接设备TX，双方共地。\n仅使用3.3V逻辑；接口无电源脚，不支持5V串口。\n设备掉电前先禁发送，将GPIO14设为输入、无上下拉。\n直连后掉电隔离减弱，工具掉电时不能依赖固件控制。\n接收下拉与器件漏电仍会影响低功耗测量，须实测。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
